## Title: The Librarium
## Author: Alianym
## Description: Custom Lore Library: Set up Keybinds in the CONTROLS menu and start reading! Books can be found in the world and in the Librarium. Write your own books and read mails you've saved, within the Librarium!
## Version: 2.32
## AddOnVersion: 000232
## APIVersion: 101048 101049
## SavedVariables: TheLibrarium
## DependsOn: LibAddonMenu-2.0>=41 LibAlianym>=40
## OptionalDependsOn: Librarian

